		(uuid "5192c395-6aa7-4c2e-8b17-a8cbdc3d8514")
	)
	(text "Description:\nThe AMP Dock is a power conversion circuit that consists of two \ndifferent buck converters that take battery inputs from a Milwaukee M18 \nand a DeWalt XR. \nThe system steps the voltage of these batteries down to feed a 12 V bus \nthat is used to output 12 V to power a fish finder device or other similar 12 V \npowered device. The 12 V bus is also parrellelly connected to a seperate buck \nconverter that steps down to 5V for USB-A and USB-C outputs for phone charging. \nThis device will be contained in a IP67 container that has mounting points for \nthe batteries and USB output ports."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 155.956 0)
		(effects
